 begin="02:44.785" end="02:44.968">beau</span><span begin="02:45.025" end="02:45.139">ti</span><span begin="02:45.301" end="02:45.835">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就是这么美</span></p><p begin="02:47.320" end="02:48.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:47.320" end="02:47.577">You're</span> <span begin="02:47.670" end="02:47.832">beau</span><span begin="02:47.895" end="02:48.018">ti</span><span begin="02:48.165" end="02:48.711">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就是这么美</span></p><p begin="02:50.108" end="02:53.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:50.108" end="02:50.501">You're</span> <span begin="02:50.600" end="02:50.832">beau</span><span begin="02:50.886" end="02:50.963">ti</span><span begin="02:51.039" end="02:51.546">ful,</span> <span begin="02:51.741" end="02:52.248">it's</span> <span begin="02:52.437" end="02:53.094">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就是这么美 这千真万确</span></p><p begin="02:55.394" end="03:00.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:55.394" end="02:55.583">There</span> <span begin="02:55.673" end="02:56.020">must</span> <span begin="02:56.169" end="02:56.542">be</span> <span begin="02:56.745" end="02:57.042">an</span> <span begin="02:57.163" end="02:58.288">angel</span> <span begin="02:58.288" end="02:58.412">with</span> <span begin="02:58.412" end="02:58.546">a</span> <span begin="02:58.621" end="02:59.071">smile</span> <span begin="02:59.206" end="02:59.358">on</span> <span begin="02:59.418" end="02:59.683">her</span> <span begin="02:59.791" end="03:00.522">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我看到了笑起来跟她一模一样的天使</span></p><p begin="03:02.707" end="03:04.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:02.707" end="03:02.835">When</span> <span begin="03:02.835" end="03:03.018">she</span> <span begin="03:03.018" end="03:03.261">thought</span> <span begin="03:03.261" end="03:03.414">up</span> <span begin="03:03.483" end="03:03.648">that</span> <span begin="03:03.648" end="03:03.840">I</span> <span begin="03:03.918" end="03:04.062">should</span> <span begin="03:04.062" end="03:04.254">be</span> <span begin="03:04.395" end="03:04.595">with</span> <span begin="03:04.644" end="03:04.961">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当她也想到我们应该在一起时</span></p><p begin="03:12.673" end="03:16.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:12.673" end="03:12.826">But</span> <span begin="03:12.826" end="03:13.030">it's</span> <span begin="03:13.151" end="03:13.656">time</span> <span begin="03:13.756" end="03:14.233">to</span> <span begin="03:14.428" end="03:15.070">face</span> <span begin="03:15.181" end="03:15.700">the</span> <span begin="03:15.910" end="03:16.768">truth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但该是面对事实的时候了</span></p><p begin="03:18.460" end="03:22.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:18.460" end="03:18.592">I</span> <span begin="03:18.691" end="03:18.904">will</span> <span begin="03:19.003" end="03:19.540">ne</span><span begin="03:19.594" end="03:20.179">ver</span> <span begin="03:20.284" end="03:20.854">be</span> <span begin="03:21.076" end="03:21.607">with</span> <span begin="03:21.778" end="03:22.288">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我和你永远无法相依</span></p></div></body></tt>